    "note": "Twenty-seven canonical conditions, including Shaken, Panicked, and Cowering. Historical fear escalation among distinct sources remains unresolved rather than silently changing native Frightened. Touch/Flat-Footed/Helpless, Stunned half Speed, conscious Petrified, Exhaustion six tiers, and Wet retained."
