      "id": "condition.blinded",
      "name": "Blinded",
      "kind": "condition",
      "description": "A Blinded creature cannot see, moves at half Speed, and suffers impaired physical defenses. Attack rolls by the creature still have Disadvantage, without an additional blindness miss-chance roll.",
