      "name": "Flat-Footed",
      "kind": "condition",
      "description": "A Flat-Footed creature cannot use applicable positive Dexterity or dodge bonuses to Armor Class and cannot make opportunity attacks. This is distinct from a temporary denial of the same AC contributions without the full condition.",
