    {
      "id": "condition.invisible",
      "name": "Invisible",
      "kind": "condition",
      "description": "An Invisible creature cannot be seen without magic or a special sense. Its location may still be detected by sound or tracks. Invisible attacks deny applicable Dexterity and dodge defenses to targets unable to see the attacker; this replaces the condition's previous attack Advantage rather than stacking with it. Attacks against the Invisible creature retain Disadvantage if the attacker cannot see it.",
