      "description": "A Panicked creature must release held objects and flee at its fastest available pace from the source of its fear and other present dangers. Its path is uncontrolled, it cannot willingly fight or undertake unrelated activities, and it can use a spell or ability only to escape. It takes a -2 penalty on saving throws, skill checks, and ability checks. When prevented from fleeing, it also becomes Cowering until it can flee again.",
